-- Every named declaration in the four owned proof modules.
-- A frozen regression specification: each allowed opening is listed by
-- its qualified name.  Most are algebra-map/finite-certificate records.
-- Quotient construction aliases (Carrier, ring, Q, image, operations)
-- occur in the concrete quotient and presented-tensor instances, as
-- described in README section 5; no shared definitions were changed.
